    "title": "Real numbers and their properties — Class 9 (Federal Board)",
    "description": "Assalam-o-Alaikum my dear students, I have prepared these comprehensive notes to help you master the fundamental concepts of real numbers for your Federal Board exams. Understanding the structure of the number system is essential for solving complex algebraic problems, so please focus on the commutative properties defined by $a + b = b + a$ and $a \\cdot b = b \\cdot a$. You should also pay close attention to the distributive laws such as $a(b + c) = ab + ac$ and the definition of rational numbers expressed as $Q = \\{ p/q \\mid p, q \\in \\mathbb{Z}, q \\neq 0 \\}$. May these notes guide you toward achieving excellent marks in your upcoming mathematics assessments.",
